  "party_basis": "as A3: state-based episode starts where the country's government is side A or side B; one-sided violence by the country's government (coalition actors not counted)",
  "run": "both; events per country under each; lead test (tied-year null, with the v1.2 null beside it) for every country-basis with at least 3 events with a full lead window. A country is listed if either basis reaches 3."
